{"id":"H2592","lemma":"חַנִּיאֵל","transliteration":"channiel","sayIt":"chan-ni-EL","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Hanniel","meaning":"A man living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, only mentioned at Num.34.23;\nson of: Ephod (H0641)\n§ Hanniel = \"favoured of God\"\n1) son of Ephod and a prince of the tribe of Manasseh\n2) son of Ulla and a chief of the tribe of Asher; also 'Haniel'","glosses":["hanniel"],"count":2,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"num-34","v":23,"renderings":{"bsb":"Hanniel","kjv":"Hanniel"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-7","v":39,"renderings":{"bsb":"Hanniel","kjv":"and Haniel"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"Numbers 34:23","note":"Of the children of Joseph: of the tribe of the children of Manasseh a prince, Hanniel the son of Ephod.","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Chronicles 7:39","note":"The sons of Ulla: Arah, Hanniel, and Rizia.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H0641","lemma":"אֵפֹד","transliteration":"ephod","gloss":"Ephod"},{"id":"H0733","lemma":"אָרַח","transliteration":"arach","gloss":"Arah"},{"id":"H7777","lemma":"שׁוּעָל","transliteration":"shual","gloss":"Shual"},{"id":"H7525","lemma":"רִצְיָא","transliteration":"ritsya","gloss":"Rizia"},{"id":"H5925","lemma":"עֻלָּא","transliteration":"ulla","gloss":"Ulla"}],"senses":[{"id":"H2592H","gloss":"Hanniel","relation":"H2592H ="}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}